[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was merged on subject lines ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject))
and marked known as one issue. Read by tenant, channel and body, the reports hold three problems.
Each one has its own ticket.

<ProblemSplit
  ticket={4471}
